  "thag1.3:0.4": "3. Kaṅkhārevatattheragāthā 3. ",
  "thag1.3:1.1": "‘‘Paññaṃ imaṃ passa tathāgatānaṃ, ",
  "thag1.3:1.2": "aggi yathā pajjalito nisīthe; ",
  "thag1.3:1.3": "Ālokadā cakkhudadā bhavanti, ",
  "thag1.3:1.4": "ye āgatānaṃ vinayanti kaṅkha’’nti. ",
  "thag1.3:1.5": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kaṅkhārevato thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthāti. "
}
